    "markup": "<div id=\"content-inner\" class=\"p-8\"><main>\n    <h1 class=\"mb-6\">Menu — JSX</h1>\n    <p class=\"mb-6 text-ink-secondary\">\n        <code>Menu</code> decorates one button trigger and renders a sibling\n        native popover containing <code>MenuItem</code> buttons. It shares the\n        same roving focus, keyboard navigation, nested-menu coordination, and\n        accessible labelling behavior as <code>&lt;neon-menu&gt;</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4\">Installation</h2>\n        <pre class=\"rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-secondary p-4\"><code>pnpm add @neon-kit/theme @neon-kit/jsx-components @slimlib/jsx\n\nimport '@neon-kit/theme/index.css';\nimport { Menu, MenuItem } from '@neon-kit/jsx-components/menu';</code></pre>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4\">Basic</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-ink-secondary\">\n            Pass one button as the trigger and menu JSX as <code>content</code>.\n            The component wires IDs, <code>popovertarget</code>, menu roles, and\n            labelling automatically.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-secondary p-6\" data-jsx-menu-demo=\"basic\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" popovertarget=\"neon-menu-a65are66g\" id=\"neon-menu-trigger-9tksspy58\">Actions</button><div id=\"neon-menu-a65are66g\" class=\"menu\" role=\"menu\" popover=\"auto\" aria-labelledby=\"neon-menu-trigger-9tksspy58\"><div class=\"menu__group\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"0\">New file<span class=\"menu__shortcut kbd-keys\"><kbd class=\"kbd\">⌘</kbd><kbd class=\"kbd\">N</kbd></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Open</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">Delete</button></div></div></div>\n        <pre class=\"mt-4 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-secondary p-4\"><code>&lt;Menu\n    content={\n        &lt;div class=\"menu__group\"&gt;\n            &lt;MenuItem onClick={createFile}&gt;New file&lt;/MenuItem&gt;\n            &lt;MenuItem&gt;Open&lt;/MenuItem&gt;\n            &lt;MenuItem disabled&gt;Delete&lt;/MenuItem&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    }\n&gt;\n    &lt;button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\"&gt;Actions&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;/Menu&gt;</code></pre>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4\">Nested menus</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-4 text-ink-secondary\">\n            Use a <code>MenuItem</code> as another <code>Menu</code>'s trigger.\n            <kbd class=\"kbd\">→</kbd> opens the submenu,\n            <kbd class=\"kbd\">←</kbd> returns to its parent item, and activating\n            a leaf closes the complete open menu tree.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-secondary p-6\" data-jsx-menu-demo=\"nested\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" popovertarget=\"neon-menu-7aqhmeo5j\" id=\"neon-menu-trigger-rpxcjdplp\">Project actions</button><div id=\"neon-menu-7aqhmeo5j\" class=\"menu\" role=\"menu\" popover=\"auto\" aria-labelledby=\"neon-menu-trigger-rpxcjdplp\"><div class=\"menu__group\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"0\">Rename</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" popovertarget=\"neon-menu-m2okuuta0\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" id=\"neon-menu-trigger-8zo1k1avd\" tabindex=\"-1\">Export as<svg class=\"menu__chevron\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"neon-menu-m2okuuta0\" class=\"menu -inline-end\" role=\"menu\" popover=\"auto\" aria-labelledby=\"neon-menu-trigger-8zo1k1avd\"><div class=\"menu__group\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"0\">PDF document</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Markdown file</button></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Archive</button></div></div></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4\">API</h2>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 text-ink-secondary\">\n            <li><code>Menu.children</code>: exactly one <code>HTMLButtonElement</code> trigger.</li>\n            <li><code>Menu.content</code>: JSX containing owned <code>MenuItem</code> descendants.</li>\n            <li><code>Menu.placement</code>: <code>block-end</code>, <code>block-start</code>, <code>inline-end</code>, or <code>inline-start</code>.</li>\n            <li><code>MenuItem.disabled</code>: creates focusable <code>aria-disabled=\"true\"</code> state and suppresses activation.</li>\n            <li><code>MenuItem.onClick</code>: runs for enabled item activation before leaf menus close.</li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n</main>\n</div>",
